5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should look at the station block's bin house and the ward complaint log.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’d like to check the block ledger and the ward subsidy. We really need to know our actual costs before deciding anything.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the statements at the residents' meeting and the truck arrival time. We need to know what people actually said and when the truck really shows up.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m picking the ward filing requirements and the supervised mornings. I need to know the paperwork burden and the actual time commitment before we commit.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log. I need to verify the physical constraints and the history of grievances.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, do you think the money will fix the smell? I just want to know if we can actually live with it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, money won’t fix the smell, but it helps us choose a solution that actually works. I’m hoping the numbers will show us what’s truly affordable for everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the smell is a symptom. I’m checking the truck time to see if the real problem is just bad timing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, I’m checking the time cost. If it eats our mornings, no amount of charm fixes that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the smell is a symptom of unequal burden. I am checking the frontages to see who physically suffers most.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the truck comes before I wake up, how do I even know if it’s there? I’m scared of the dark!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, don’t worry, the truck comes early, but we can set up a simple system so you don’t have to be out there in the dark.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen. You won’t be out there in the dark, but the window is tight.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Rin, the window is tight, but I’m checking the supervised mornings to see if we can actually manage it without burning out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the truck time is irrelevant to the structural inequality. I am measuring the frontages to prove who bears the physical burden.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, but if the truck comes before I wake up, how do I even know if it’s there? I’m scared of the dark!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I understand your worry. We will make sure the system is safe and simple, so you never have to be out there alone in the dark.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, you’re nine. You’re not the one hauling bags at dawn. I’m checking the statements to see who actually wants to do that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@Rin, you’re safe inside. I’m checking the hours to see if the adults can handle the early starts without falling apart.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
