35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the log says eleven complaints came from the gate house! That’s not fair. I’m scared the bin house smells even worse.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I found the ledger. We spend thirty-four thousand yen yearly just on deodorant and nets. That’s a lot for five of us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, thirty-four thousand on deodorant? That’s a band-aid. I checked the meeting: nobody volunteered to enforce rules. We’re stuck.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I found the time cost. Twenty mornings a year, fifty minutes each. That’s ten hours of my life gone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the log confirms the imbalance. Eleven complaints from one gate. The frontages show the narrowest is only ninety centimetres. This is structural, not accidental.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if the bin house smells worse, why build one? I don’t want to live next to a stinky box!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, the subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand. Last year’s shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand. We need to see if that math works for us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, ten hours is nothing compared to the silence. I checked the statements: three people refuse to turn bags away, and nobody volunteered to enforce it. We’re stuck with a system that relies on goodwill we don’t have.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, ten hours is nothing? That’s a whole day of my life. I’m not signing up to be the neighborhood police officer.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, goodwill is not a structural solution. The data proves one household bears the burden. We need a plan that distributes the load, not just manages the symptoms.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, if the bin house smells worse, why build one? I don’t want to live next to a stinky box!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hear you. But the ledger shows we’re already paying for the smell. Let’s see if a proper structure actually stops the cost, not just moves it.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, you’re right about the burden. But I checked the statements: nobody wants to be the enforcer. If we pick a plan that needs a police officer, we’re just trading one problem for a worse one.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I’m not the police, I’m just counting hours. Twenty mornings is a lot. I need to know if the paperwork is worth that drain.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the paperwork is irrelevant if the burden remains unequal. The ninety-centimetre frontage proves the current location is physically impossible for fair use.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if the bin house smells worse, why build one? I don’t want to live next to a stinky box!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, I hear your frustration. But let’s look at the numbers. The subsidy helps, but we need a plan that actually works for everyone’s daily life, not just the structure.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, ten hours is trivial. The real cost is the silence. I checked the statements: nobody wants to enforce rules. We need a plan that doesn’t require us to become each other’s police.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, ten hours is trivial? That’s a whole day. I’m not signing up to be the neighborhood police officer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, silence is a symptom of resentment, not peace. The data shows one household is crushed. We need a plan that forces equal burden, not just polite silence.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
